        {
          "text": "Baririmba indirimbo nsha, bati Birakubereye kwābīra igitabo, no kumena ibikimatanije, kuko wishwe, ugacungurira Imana abo mu miryango yose no mu ndimi zose no mu moko yose no mu mahanga yose, ubacunguje amaraso yawe, ",
